Biome Postcards
Copyright (c) 2026 Tacoparoni (Marwin5411-Winner, pipothai). All Rights Reserved.

Biome Postcards (the "Add-On") means the behavior pack, the resource pack, the
scripts, textures, models, interface files, texts and documentation distributed
under that name.

1. WHAT YOU MAY DO

   You may, free of charge:

   a. download the Add-On from an official source and play with it;
   b. use it in your own worlds, on Realms and on servers you run, including
      servers that send the packs to their players when they join;
   c. show it in videos, streams and screenshots, monetised or not;
   d. include it in a pack list or collection by linking to an official page.

   Official sources are the Tacoparoni website and the project pages that the
   authors themselves publish (for example on CurseForge and MCPEDL).

2. WHAT YOU MAY NOT DO

   Without written permission from the authors you may not:

   a. reupload the Add-On's files, changed or unchanged, to any other site,
      file host, app or store; link to an official page instead;
   b. put the download behind a paywall or a link that pays you, or sell the
      Add-On or any part of it;
   c. publish it, or a work made from its files, under another name or as your
      own work;
   d. remove or change the names of the authors, this file or CREDITS;
   e. reuse its textures, models, interface files or scripts in another
      project.

   Changing the files for your own private use is fine.

